(7262984, 1129220, 97225, '<td valign="top">Oh! I''m so glad I failed to get my entry in at the last second because yours is so much better. Your banana is nice and fresh (mine almost instantly got horrible marks on it as soon as I mucked around with it). I also like your colour matched zip.</td>', 'Oh! I''m so glad I failed to get my entry in at the last second because yours is so much better. Your banana is nice and fresh (mine almost instantly got horrible marks on it as soon as I mucked around with it). I also like your colour matched zip.', '2014-09-14 23:19:36.000000', NULL, 1),
