(7262989, 1129184, 13077, '<td valign="top">Very cool. I love the transistion from focus to bokeh - interested to see what lens this is, I''m guessing a fast manual focus prime.<br/>There''s just a little bit of detail showing in the black areas to the left of the zipper - I think either blacking it out or actually showing some texture would have helped.</td>', 'Very cool. I love the transistion from focus to bokeh - interested to see what lens this is, I''m guessing a fast manual focus prime.There''s just a little bit of detail showing in the black areas to the left of the zipper - I think either blacking it out or actually showing some texture would have helped.', '2014-09-14 23:45:50.000000', NULL, 1),
