(7263003, 1129228, 34114, '<td valign="top">Thanks everyone for votes and comments...much appreciated. If there was an image that I would have wanted to win a ribbon in all my time here at DPC it would be this one! God is good!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2014-09-15 00:36:28.</i></td>', 'Thanks everyone for votes and comments...much appreciated. If there was an image that I would have wanted to win a ribbon in all my time here at DPC it would be this one! God is good!', '2014-09-15 01:16:14.000000', '2014-09-15 01:36:28.000000', 0),
