(7263262, 1129344, 103142, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by littlemav:</b></div><hr/><i> You got my highest score, I was hopeing this was legal because it looked toooo real!!! Great Job my friend, humm gaffers tape, is that a theatrical product?  My good ol'' stand by Duck tape has too much shine for things like this.... </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>The gaffers tape that I have seems to be a fabric tape, so there''s no shine to it -- it''s a nice, flat black and worked quite well for this!</td>', 'Originally posted by littlemav: You got my highest score, I was hopeing this was legal because it looked toooo real!!! Great Job my friend, humm gaffers tape, is that a theatrical product?  My good ol'' stand by Duck tape has too much shine for things like this....   The gaffers tape that I have seems to be a fabric tape, so there''s no shine to it -- it''s a nice, flat black and worked quite well for this!', '2014-09-15 13:09:21.000000', NULL, 0),
